  "ingredients": [
    "24 ounce salmon",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "5 teaspoon fresh garlic (diced)",
    "1/2 medium yellow onion (diced)",
    "1/3 cup vegetable broth",
    "3 tablespoon sun-dried tomatoes",
    "1 cup heavy cream",
    "6 ounce baby spinach",
    "1/4 cup parmesan cheese",
    "1 tablespoon fresh parsley (chopped)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat the olive oil over medium to high heat in a frying pan. Sear the salmon on both sides for about 5 minutes or until they are cooked thoroughly. Once cooked, remove salmon from the pan and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt the butter using the same pan. Add the diced garlic and stir together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the onion and cook until it's translucent.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the sun-dried tomatoes and stir to combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, add in the vegetable broth and let everything cook for a few minutes until everything simmers down.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the heavy cream and stir to combine well. Cook for a few minutes until the mixture starts to get thicker.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the spinach into the frying pan and cook until it is wilty, then add the parmesan cheese. Combine well and let this cook for 1 - 2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the frying pan is still on the heat, add in the salmon to let the salmon get hot again.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with parsley.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Creamy-Tuscan-Salmon-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-creamy-tuscan-salmon/#wprm-recipe-53905-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
